          "text": "{\"blocks\":[{\"k\":\"t\",\"v\":\"I’d choose the Aeroplan award via Beijing if arriving earlier and having more reported award seats matter most. The tradeoff is a much longer journey and a long connection; the award via Taipei is substantially shorter overall, but arrives later.\"},{\"k\":\"p\",\"r\":\"J3@2027-01-15T11:00-08:00/SFO>BKK/E>2027-01-17T11:05\",\"n\":\"Recommended: Aeroplan award via Beijing\",\"v\":\"Departs SFO January 15 at 11:00 a.m. and arrives at BKK January 17 at 11:05 a.m., via PEK, with one stop and an 805-minute (13-hour-25-minute) connection. The award is reported as economy on TG and UA, with 9 seats shown; individual leg cabins are not specified. Price: 65,000 Aeroplan points plus CAD 102 in quoted taxes and fees. Its advantage over the Taipei award is the earlier arrival and higher reported seat count. The downside is a 1,985-minute (33-hour-5-minute) journey.\"},{\"k\":\"a\",\"r\":\"J13@2027-01-15T23:30-08:00/SFO>BKK/E>2027-01-17T16:50\",\"n\":\"Alternative: Aeroplan award via Taipei\",\"v\":\"Departs SFO January 15 at 11:30 p.m. and arrives at BKK January 17 at 4:50 p.m., via TPE, with one stop and a 495-minute (8-hour-15-minute) connection. The award is reported as economy on BR and TG, with 1 seat shown; individual leg cabins are not specified. Price: 65,000 Aeroplan points plus CAD 116.50 in quoted taxes and fees. Choose this over the recommendation if the shorter overall journey matters more than arriving earlier. It takes 1,580 minutes (26 hours 20 minutes), but arrives later.\"},{\"k\":\"t\",\"v\":\"For these two shown awards, the Beijing option arrives 5 hours 45 minutes earlier.\"},{\"k\":\"x\",\"r\":\"T02\"},{\"k\":\"t\",\"v\":\"The Taipei option’s elapsed journey is 6 hours 45 minutes shorter; that is a journey-duration difference, not an arrival-time difference.\"},{\"k\":\"x\",\"r\":\"T03\"},{\"k\":\"b\",\"r\":\"C1@2027-01-15T09:40-08:00/SFO>BKK\",\"n\":\"Cash baseline: Singapore Airlines via Singapore\",\"v\":\"The search shows an SFO–SIN–BKK cash itinerary departing January 15 at 9:40 a.m. and arriving January 17 at 8:25 a.m., with one stop and a 1,905-minute (31-hour-45-minute) duration. The quoted fare is USD 440. Its price scope is unspecified, so it cannot be treated as a confirmed per-person, party-total, or all-in price.\"},{\"k\":\"t\",\"v\":\"Both award choices are single-award itineraries. Their points and fee quotes do not establish a complete trip cost: the fee scope is unspecified, and the search does not provide a comparable total price. The reported award cabin is economy, but the cabin on each individual flight is not specified. Seat counts and prices may not be real-time; confirm current availability and terms with the booking program before deciding.\"}]}",
